どっちがいい？ どっちがいい？ OK.
Which way is better? Which way is better? OK.

519
00:31:36,048 --> 00:31:39,048
ほらほらもう栄養、栄養の成果！
Look, look, it's the results of the nutrition!

520
00:31:39,048 --> 00:31:42,048
栄養ダンス！ 栄養ダンスか！
Nutrition dance! A nutrition dance?!

521
00:31:42,048 --> 00:31:48,048
いやー本当に楽しかったです！ ありがとうございました！
Man, that was really fun! Thank you so much!

522
00:31:48,048 --> 00:31:50,048
Thank you! Thank you.

523
00:31:50,048 --> 00:31:54,548
I'm so happy that all my, you know, lovely friends could join me...

524
00:31:54,548 --> 00:31:57,548
Best friends! Best of friends!

525
00:31:57,548 --> 00:32:01,048
...could join me in celebrating my 5th anniversary.

526
00:32:01,048 --> 00:32:05,548
And, you know, not only I get to celebrate it with Vegemite...

527
00:32:05,548 --> 00:32:08,548
...but also with these lovely ladies.

528
00:32:08,548 --> 00:32:11,048
And also, I have a huge announcement!

529
00:32:11,048 --> 00:32:14,048
ビッグ... ビッグアナウンス？
A big... big announcement?

530
00:32:14,048 --> 00:32:17,048
ビッグアナウンスがあります！
I have a big announcement!

531
00:32:17,048 --> 00:32:20,548
Big what? Big...?

532
00:32:21,548 --> 00:32:26,548
ビッグアナウンスメントが来ましたので、ちょっとみんな一緒に、「どうぞ」で言ってくれますか？
Since the big announcement is here, could everyone say "take a look" together with me?

533
00:32:26,548 --> 00:32:29,548
OK! OK! よいしょ！
OK! OK! Here we go!

534
00:32:29,548 --> 00:32:34,048
If you're all ready, it's time for the huge announcement! Please take a look at this!

535
00:32:34,048 --> 00:32:37,548
どうぞー！
Here it is!

536
00:32:38,548 --> 00:32:44,048
What moves thy heart?

537
00:32:44,548 --> 00:32:50,048
What is thy true desire?

538
00:32:51,548 --> 00:32:57,048
The fallen crown awaits from the shadows...

539
00:32:59,548 --> 00:33:03,548
Her time has come,

540
00:33:04,548 --> 00:33:07,048
No one will ever question her rule again.

541
00:33:07,048 --> 00:33:09,548
2026.12.01

542
00:33:09,548 --> 00:33:12,048
Hakos Baelz

543
00:33:12,048 --> 00:33:14,548
1st Concert

544
00:33:15,048 --> 00:33:20,048
I'll run the world, don't be afraid, it ain't a thing if you win

545
00:33:20,048 --> 00:33:24,548
満たされないパワー 暴走した
An unsatisfied power went wild

546
00:33:24,548 --> 00:33:28,548
Give me more, I need more, oh you'll be begging on the floor

547
00:33:28,548 --> 00:33:33,548
自分次第の生涯 僕のShowtime
A lifetime up to oneself, it's my Showtime

548
00:33:34,048 --> 00:33:40,548
Offer up thy soul and kneel.

549
00:33:40,548 --> 00:33:47,048
For those who bow before her will...

550
00:33:47,048 --> 00:33:50,548
WITNESS HER LEGACY!

551
00:33:54,048 --> 00:33:57,548
あああ！
Ahhh!

552
00:33:57,548 --> 00:34:01,048
I finally told you!

553
00:34:01,048 --> 00:34:04,548
I can't believe it guys, I did it!

554
00:34:04,548 --> 00:34:10,048
I am finally holding my very own solo concert!

555
00:34:10,048 --> 00:34:14,548
ソロライブ決定です！ やったー！
Solo concert confirmed! Yay!

556
00:34:15,548 --> 00:34:20,048
Ah! I'm so happy!

557
00:34:20,048 --> 00:34:24,048
本当にありがとうございました！
Thank you so very much!

558
00:34:24,048 --> 00:34:28,548
It's gonna be happening on December 1st of this year...

559
00:34:28,548 --> 00:34:34,048
...and the venue is none other than Kanadevia Hall in Tokyo!

560
00:34:34,048 --> 00:34:39,048
えっとなんと、12月1日、決定されました！ ソロライブです！
And on December 1st, it's been confirmed! It's a solo live!

561
00:34:39,048 --> 00:34:44,548
えっ東京のKanadevia Hallで開催決定です！
And it's confirmed to be held at Kanadevia Hall in Tokyo!

562
00:34:44,548 --> 00:34:48,548
もう決定... 決定ですよみんな！ やったー！
It's already confirmed... It's confirmed everyone! Yay!

563
00:34:48,548 --> 00:34:52,548
えっ、ライブのタイトルは『REGALIA』。
And the title of the live is "REGALIA".

564
00:34:52,548 --> 00:34:54,548
This is the title of the live, REGALIA.

565
00:34:54,548 --> 00:35:00,048
I chose this title because I wanted this live to, you know, be, or to become a...

566
00:35:00,056 --> 00:35:02,556
...symbol of my journey so far, and hopefully

567
00:35:02,556 --> 00:35:05,456
a symbol for what is yet to come for

568
00:35:05,456 --> 00:35:07,756
a Bae take... course, you know?

569
00:35:08,256 --> 00:35:11,356
ええと、ま、今回のライブタイトルは「REGALIA」です。
Um, well, the title of this live concert is "REGALIA."

570
00:35:11,456 --> 00:35:15,556
このライブはね、僕のこれまでの活動を象徴にするぞという...
This concert, with the intention of making it a symbol...

571
00:35:15,556 --> 00:35:18,556
意思を込めて、このタイトルにしました！
...of my journey and activities so far, is why I chose this title!

572
00:35:19,056 --> 00:35:24,756
ええと、チケットやグッズの情報は後日発表しますので、もう少々...少し待っててください。
Um, information about tickets and merchandise will be announced at a later date, so please wait just a little longer.

573
00:35:25,056 --> 00:35:27,256
Tickets and goods will be announced later on.

574
00:35:27,456 --> 00:35:29,556
Please get hyped!

575
00:35:29,556 --> 00:35:32,756
I did it! I did it!

576
00:35:33,256 --> 00:35:35,056
And there's more!

577
00:35:35,256 --> 00:35:37,756
In celebration of my first ever solo live,

578
00:35:37,756 --> 00:35:41,256
I am so happy to announce that my second album, "Mirror Mirror",

579
00:35:41,556 --> 00:35:43,756
is on its way!

580
00:35:44,056 --> 00:35:48,856
Pre-orders will open today from 9:00 PM JST on the hololive production official shop.

581
00:35:49,056 --> 00:35:55,756
そして、ええと、ま、ライブに向けて、セカンドアルバムも、あの、出ます！
And, um, leading up to the live concert, my second album is also coming out!

582
00:35:55,856 --> 00:35:58,856
「Mirror Mirror」というリリースが、あの、決定しました！
The release of "Mirror Mirror" has been confirmed!

583
00:35:59,056 --> 00:36:03,256
ええと、日本時間で今日23日の夜9時から、
Starting from 9:00 PM tonight on the 23rd, JST,

584
00:36:03,256 --> 00:36:09,056
ええと、ホロライブプロダクション公式ショップで、あの、ま、受注開始されます！
pre-orders will open on the hololive production official shop!

585
00:36:09,356 --> 00:36:12,856
ありがとうございます！本当にありがとうございます。
Thank you so much! Truly, thank you.

586
00:36:13,256 --> 00:36:17,556
Um, this album is so special to me. Uh, it includes many songs.

587
00:36:17,856 --> 00:36:22,556
Um, actually I wrote the lyrics of most of the songs on this album,

588
00:36:22,756 --> 00:36:26,356
uh with the theme of reflection, facing oneself,

589
00:36:26,456 --> 00:36:31,756
and this album was a project where I pushed myself to explore even more ways to express myself as an artist.

590
00:36:32,056 --> 00:36:38,956
ええとなんとですね、今回のアルバムの曲は大体全部、歌詞の方は自分で書いてました。
And amazingly, I wrote the lyrics for almost all the songs on this album myself.

591
00:36:39,256 --> 00:36:44,756
ええと、まあ、リフレクション、自己との向き合いっていうテーマにして、
Um, with the theme of "reflection" and facing oneself,

592
00:36:44,956 --> 00:36:51,556
ま、アーティストとしてのさらなる表現力をええと追求したい作品となってます！
it's a project where I sought to further pursue my expressive power as an artist!

593
00:36:52,056 --> 00:36:55,756
Uh, it also comes with a lot of uh album bonuses.

594
00:36:55,856 --> 00:37:02,056
You'll receive a special message letter with my signature, an original mirror sticker, and an artbook-style lyric booklet.

595
00:37:02,356 --> 00:37:06,056
I'll be signing every single one of them, so please get it!

596
00:37:06,356 --> 00:37:09,556
あとね、アルバム購入特典もあります！
Also, there are album purchase bonuses!

597
00:37:09,656 --> 00:37:14,656
サイン付きのスペシャルメッセージ（日本語版も英語版もあります）、オリジナルミラーステッカーもあります！
A special message letter with my signature (available in Japanese and English), and an original mirror sticker!

598
00:37:14,856 --> 00:37:17,656
アートブック型のあの歌詞カードもあります！
There's also an artbook-style lyric card booklet!

599
00:37:17,856 --> 00:37:24,656
ええ、もう買ってくれ-てくれたみんなもう、サイン、サインをしますので、ぜひぜひよろしくお願いします。
For everyone who purchases it, I will be signing them, so please look forward to it!

600
00:37:25,356 --> 00:37:28,856
Uh you can check the shop directly from YouTube,

601
00:37:28,856 --> 00:37:35,356
um and both the album shipments and the digital release are scheduled for November 2nd JST.

602
00:37:35,356 --> 00:37:38,956
So get hyped! Stay tuned! There's a lot yet to come!

603
00:37:39,556 --> 00:37:44,556
ええと、YouTubeからショップへアクセスできるので、ぜひチェックしてください。
Um, you can access the shop directly from YouTube, so please check it out.

604
00:37:44,756 --> 00:37:50,556
また、発送と、え、デジタルリリースは11月2日の予定となっております。
Also, shipments and the digital release are scheduled for November 2nd.

605
00:37:50,756 --> 00:37:53,356
楽しみにしといてください！
Please look forward to it!

606
00:37:53,456 --> 00:37:55,556
そして、そして、そして！
And, and, and!

607
00:37:55,556 --> 00:38:00,056
Uh, I may have mentioned before that there is a new song releasing today, and that is right!

608
00:38:00,056 --> 00:38:04,556
Right after this stream, the music video for "I found me",

609
00:38:04,556 --> 00:38:13,256
which is a very, very special song that is actually the first song I ever wrote from scratch, will be releasing—will be premiering after this stream!

610
00:38:13,556 --> 00:38:21,056
ええと、この配信が終わった時、ちょっと、あの、アルバムからの1曲「I found me」のMVが公開します！
Um, after this stream ends, the MV for "I found me," a song from the album, will be premiered!

611
00:38:21,256 --> 00:38:28,556
この曲は僕にとってめっちゃ大事な曲なんで、そして初めて一から書いた曲なんで（あの歌詞の方ね）。
This song is super important to me, and it's the first song I ever wrote from scratch (the lyrics, that is).

612
00:38:28,656 --> 00:38:33,056
なのでぜひぜひ、プレミア公開、よろしくお願いします！
So please, make sure to check out the premiere!

613
00:38:33,256 --> 00:38:37,756
The MV will be the opening video for my segment during YouTube Music Weekend!

614
00:38:37,956 --> 00:38:41,556
Tada! That's a lot! I'm so happy!

615
00:38:41,756 --> 00:38:45,056
My fifth anniversary and I get to be part of YouTube Music Weekend!

616
00:38:45,356 --> 00:38:51,556
Um so it'll be the opening video for my section which starts at 1:15 PM JST, so make sure to check it out!

617
00:38:51,756 --> 00:38:59,056
このMVはこの後13時15分からスタートするYouTube Music Weekendで僕のオープニングパートにもなってるので、
This MV will also be the opening part of my segment for YouTube Music Weekend starting at 1:15 PM,

618
00:38:59,056 --> 00:39:03,056
ぜひぜひこれもチェックしてください！
so please be sure to check this out as well!

619
00:39:04,556 --> 00:39:06,356
That is us!

620
00:39:06,556 --> 00:39:09,556
That was a lot of announcements.

621
00:39:09,656 --> 00:39:15,456
Are you guys, are you guys proud of me? I got this out alive!

622
00:39:15,556 --> 00:39:19,556
You guys know why I've been so busy now!

623
00:39:19,756 --> 00:39:25,556
I've been busy... I've been already doing a lot of prep for this amazing event that's happening,

624
00:39:25,756 --> 00:39:30,656
and I'll be sharing more details about the concert at a later date, so I really hope you look forward to it!

625
00:39:30,856 --> 00:39:37,556
ええと、まあ、最近ちょっと僕ね、あの、疲れてるプラスめっちゃ忙しくなった理由もこれになりますので、
Um, well, this is the reason why I've been a bit tired recently and super busy,

626
00:39:37,756 --> 00:39:42,056
本当に頑張りますので、あの、楽しみにしててください！
so I'll really do my best, and please look forward to it!

627
00:39:42,556 --> 00:39:46,056
All right! With that being said, I think it's time to move on to the next segment!

628
00:39:46,256 --> 00:39:49,056
ちょっと次のコーナーに行きたいと思います！
I'd like to move on to the next segment!

629
00:39:58,556 --> 00:40:00,056
Welcome to...

630
00:40:00,104 --> 00:40:03,904
ベジマイトコンテスト〜！イエーイ！
The Bae-gemite Concoctions! Yeah!

631
00:40:03,904 --> 00:40:08,604
イエーイ！イエイ、イエイ！
Yeah! Yeah, yeah!

632
00:40:08,604 --> 00:40:12,804
イエーイ！うおおお！
Yeah! Uoohhh!

633
00:40:12,804 --> 00:40:17,104
見てる方も、I think everyone knows, but 一応自己紹介お願いしていいですか？
To everyone watching... I think everyone knows, but could you please introduce yourselves?

634
00:40:17,104 --> 00:40:18,504
はい！もちろんございます。
Yes! Of course.

635
00:40:18,504 --> 00:40:23,604
じゃあ私から。えー、ホロスターズの夕刻ロベルです！本日はよろしくお願いいたします！
Then starting with me. I'm Yukoku Roberu from HOLOSTARS! Pleased to be here today!

636
00:40:23,604 --> 00:40:24,904
イエーイ！
Yay!

637
00:40:24,904 --> 00:40:27,804
なんか不穏な感じがね、しますけど。
I'm sensing somewhat ominous vibes, though.

638
00:40:27,804 --> 00:40:28,804
そうですね。
Right.

639
00:40:28,804 --> 00:40:30,104
はい、怖いです。
Yes, it's scary.

640
00:40:30,104 --> 00:40:31,504
怖くないね。
It's not scary!

641
00:40:31,504 --> 00:40:34,904
あ、怖くないもんね？怖くないです。頑張りたいと思います。よろしくお願いします！
Ah, it's not scary, right? Not scary at all. I'll do my best. Looking forward to this!

642
00:40:34,904 --> 00:40:36,304
お願いします！そして？
Welcome! And next?

643
00:40:36,304 --> 00:40:40,004
はい！あの、理由も分からず呼び出されて、
Yes! Um, I was summoned here without knowing why,

644
00:40:40,004 --> 00:40:44,704
仕事だと思って来たら、なんだか不穏なスタジオでした。石川界人です。声優です。よろしくお願いします！
and showed up thinking it was a regular gig, only to find a sketchy studio. I'm voice actor Kaito Ishikawa. Nice to meet you!

645
00:40:44,704 --> 00:40:48,104
よろしくお願いします！お願いしまーす！
Nice to meet you! / Welcome!

646
00:40:48,104 --> 00:40:51,604
そんな我々からもちょっとベーちゃんに言わなきゃいけないことあります！ / ありますね！
And we also have something we need to say to you, Bae-chan! / We sure do!

647
00:40:51,604 --> 00:40:54,004
行きましょう！せーの！
Let's do it! Ready, set...

648
00:40:54,004 --> 00:41:00,404
ソロライブ開催決定、おめでとーーー！
Congratulations on your solo live concert announcement!

649
00:41:00,404 --> 00:41:03,104
ありがとうございます！ / すごいことよ！
Thank you so much! / That's incredible!

650
00:41:03,104 --> 00:41:05,604
あ、泣いちゃった？あーららら。
Ah, are you crying? Oh, my, my.

651
00:41:05,604 --> 00:41:08,104
嬉しい... / 嬉しいな。いや、すごいことよ！おめでとう！
I'm so happy... / Happy tears. Truly, it's amazing! Congrats!

652
00:41:08,104 --> 00:41:10,604
ありがとうございます。 / 本当におめでとう！
Thank you so much. / Huge congratulations!

653
00:41:10,604 --> 00:41:14,404
なんか、一VTuberファンとしてさ、ソロライブっていうのは夢じゃん！
As a fellow VTuber fan, having a solo live concert is the ultimate dream!

654
00:41:14,404 --> 00:41:18,604
夢ですね！本当にありがとうございます。
It really is a dream! Thank you so much.

655
00:41:18,604 --> 00:41:23,604
なんかもう熱いわ！ / 泣いてる。 / ありがとうございます！
Man, it really gets you emotional! / She's crying. / Thank you so much!

656
00:41:23,604 --> 00:41:26,604
本当に、素晴らしい、本当。
Truly wonderful, really.

657
00:41:26,604 --> 00:41:30,104
えっと、今日はね、チャレンジをやりたいと思います！
So today, we're going to take on a challenge!

658
00:41:30,104 --> 00:41:32,304
チャレンジ！いいですね、挑戦。
A challenge! Sounds great, a challenge.

659
00:41:32,304 --> 00:41:34,604
チャ、チャレンジですね、チャレンジ。
A cha... challenge, yes, a challenge.

660
00:41:34,604 --> 00:41:42,104
Today we've invited these two for a challenge called "The Bae-gemite Concoctions"! We've come up with some absolutely outrageous Vegemite concoctions...

661
00:41:42,104 --> 00:41:47,404
まあ、ロベさんと界人さんはもうベジマイトのことはご存知しておりますよね？ / もちろん。
Well, Robe-san and Kaito-san, you both already know all about Vegemite, right? / Of course.

662
00:41:47,404 --> 00:41:51,604
なんか当たり前のように口にしてるけど、そのなんか... / 大好物？
You talk about it like it's totally normal, but... / Favorite food?

663
00:41:51,604 --> 00:41:57,904
我々にとっては、その、呪詛みたいなもんだから、その... その、そう、あの、怖いのよ、結構。
For us, it's practically a curse, you know... So, yeah, it's actually pretty terrifying.

664
00:41:57,904 --> 00:42:01,104
ベジマイトって言ったら、まあロベさんですよね？
When you think of Vegemite, you think of Robe-san, right?

665
00:42:01,104 --> 00:42:07,604
正直このベジマイトという道を作ってしまった発端の人物かもしれない。
Honestly, I might be the very origin that paved the road of Vegemite.

666
00:42:07,604 --> 00:42:08,604
そうです！
Exactly!

667
00:42:08,604 --> 00:42:16,104
あの、そう、ベーちゃんにそのベジマイトっていうものがあるよって教えてもらって、僕がその実食配信みたいなのをするようになったんですよ。
Bae-chan told me about Vegemite, and that led me to do a stream tasting it live.

668
00:42:16,104 --> 00:42:18,904
そこから始まった、この地獄は。多分。
And that's where this whole hell began. Probably.

669
00:42:18,904 --> 00:42:22,604
え、そして被害者が... / 被害者たちが生まれていった。
And then the victims... / More and more victims were born.

670
00:42:22,604 --> 00:42:27,904
そう、で、一緒にね、その配信で食レポみたいな配信もしたことがあって。
Yeah, and we even did a stream together where we did a food review of it.

671
00:42:27,904 --> 00:42:34,604
で、それ以来なんで、こいつと対峙するのは3、4年ぶりぐらいになりますが、まあ...
And I haven't faced this thing since then, so it's been about 3 or 4 years, but well...

672
00:42:34,604 --> 00:42:37,104
じゃあもう味も忘れちゃってそうだもんね？
Then you must have forgotten how it tastes by now, right?

673
00:42:37,104 --> 00:42:39,104
うん、あのね、こびりついてる。
No, see... it's burned into my memory.

674
00:42:39,104 --> 00:42:43,104
4年経っても消えない。 / 言い方！ / 味の記憶がこびりついてる。
Even after 4 years, it hasn't faded. / Watch your phrasing! / The taste is seared into my brain.

675
00:42:44,104 --> 00:42:49,104
うん、だから非常にね、怖さはあるけど、まあでもね、楽しみですよ。
Yeah, so there's definitely fear, but hey, I'm looking forward to it.

676
00:42:49,104 --> 00:42:51,604
も、もっと元気そうに。 / 楽しみです！
S-sound a bit more energetic! / I'm looking forward to it!

677
00:42:51,604 --> 00:42:55,104
イエーイ！すごい楽しみ！食べたい！
Yay! So excited! Can't wait to eat!

678
00:42:55,104 --> 00:42:58,604
そして界人さん、あの、ベジマイトエピソードっていうことはありますか？
And Kaito-san, do you have any Vegemite stories?

679
00:42:58,604 --> 00:43:04,304
