Saying words like "just an idol"—

1136
01:07:57,679 --> 01:08:00,679
見てもいないくせに言うな
Don't say that when you haven't even watched!

1137
01:08:00,679 --> 01:08:03,679
頑張りを当然と言うな
Don't take my hard work for granted!

1138
01:08:03,679 --> 01:08:06,679
イメージとか強制するな
Don't force your image on me!

1139
01:08:06,679 --> 01:08:09,379
“アイドルなんか”という言葉は
The phrase "just an idol"...

1140
01:08:09,379 --> 01:08:13,679
この世で一番大嫌いだ
...is what I hate most in this world!

1141
01:08:23,979 --> 01:08:29,179
プライベート 見えないから 分からないと思います
You can't see my private life, so you probably wouldn't know,

1142
01:08:29,379 --> 01:08:34,679
性格とか 悪い方です 騙しちゃっていますか？
but my personality is kind of bad. Did I manage to fool you?

1143
01:08:34,979 --> 01:08:40,979
でも本気です 本気なんです ありのままの私を
But I'm serious, I really mean it! The real me, just as I am—

1144
01:08:40,979 --> 01:08:46,679
好きになって 推して下さい それってワガママですか？
Please love me and support me. Is that asking for too much?

1145
01:08:47,179 --> 01:08:52,679
きっと可愛くない 全部分かってる
I'm sure I'm not cute; I know it all too well.

1146
01:08:52,979 --> 01:08:58,379
それでも好かれてたい アイドルだから
Even so, I want to be loved, because I'm an idol.

1147
01:08:58,679 --> 01:09:01,479
皮肉言う奴は嫌いだ
I hate people who say sarcastic things.

1148
01:09:01,479 --> 01:09:04,379
言い訳ばかりも嫌いだ
I hate making excuses all the time too.

1149
01:09:04,379 --> 01:09:06,979
“こんなもんか”という言葉を
Saying words like "is this all?"—

1150
01:09:06,979 --> 01:09:09,979
軽々しく口にするな
Don't utter them so lightly!

1151
01:09:09,979 --> 01:09:12,979
勝手に限界決めるな
Don't go setting limits on me!

1152
01:09:12,979 --> 01:09:15,979
笑い者になんてするな
Don't make a laughingstock out of me!

1153
01:09:15,979 --> 01:09:18,679
“アイドルなんか”という言葉は
The phrase "just an idol"...

1154
01:09:18,679 --> 01:09:22,379
この世で一番大嫌いだ
...is what I hate most in this world!

1155
01:09:22,379 --> 01:09:25,379
向かい風を切り裂け
Cut through the headwind!

1156
01:09:25,379 --> 01:09:29,979
誇り高きアイドル
A proud idol...

1157
01:09:32,679 --> 01:09:35,179
目指そうぜ
Let's aim for it!

1158
01:09:39,479 --> 01:09:42,479
応援がなければ 活動できない
Without your support, I can't keep going.

1159
01:09:42,479 --> 01:09:45,479
好きな事ばかりじゃ 生きてはいけない
I can't live doing only what I like.

1160
01:09:45,479 --> 01:09:48,179
元気あげるはずが もらってばかりだし
I was supposed to give you energy, but I'm always receiving it instead.

1161
01:09:48,179 --> 01:09:53,979
恩返しできる日まで 待ってて
Until the day I can repay you... wait for me!

1162
01:09:54,179 --> 01:09:56,679
待っててね！
Wait for me, okay?!

1163
01:09:56,679 --> 01:09:59,979
12月！約束だ！
December! That's a promise!

1164
01:10:02,994 --> 01:10:07,894
歓声が減っても 飽きられちゃっても
Even if the cheers fade, even if people get bored of me,

1165
01:10:08,394 --> 01:10:13,994
それでも笑っていたい アイドルだから
I still want to keep smiling, because I'm an idol.

1166
01:10:14,394 --> 01:10:16,994
熱いファンの愛があって
With the passionate love of my fans,

1167
01:10:17,094 --> 01:10:19,594
スタッフさんの愛があって
with the love of the staff,

1168
01:10:19,694 --> 01:10:22,694
いつも家族の愛があって
and always with the love of my family...

1169
01:10:22,994 --> 01:10:24,194
生きてる
...I'm living as...

1170
01:10:24,194 --> 01:10:25,594
アイドル！
...an idol!

1171
01:10:25,694 --> 01:10:27,994
バカにする奴は嫌いだ
I hate people who make fun of us!

1172
01:10:28,094 --> 01:10:30,694
見下されるのも嫌いだ
I hate being looked down upon too!

1173
01:10:30,894 --> 01:10:33,994
“アイドルなんか”という言葉を
Don't say words like "just an idol"...

1174
01:10:34,094 --> 01:10:36,694
見てもいないくせに言うな
...when you haven't even watched!

1175
01:10:36,794 --> 01:10:39,694
頑張りを当然と言うな
Don't treat hard work as a given!

1176
01:10:39,794 --> 01:10:42,694
イメージとか強制するな
Don't force your image on us!

1177
01:10:42,894 --> 01:10:45,994
“アイドルなんか”という言葉は
Words like "just an idol"...

1178
01:10:46,094 --> 01:10:51,694
この世で一番大嫌いだ
...are what I hate most in this world!

1179
01:10:53,194 --> 01:10:55,194
ありがとうねー！
Thank you!

1180
01:10:55,294 --> 01:10:57,994
MV見て！MV見て！
Watch the MV! Watch the MV!

1181
01:11:00,194 --> 01:11:03,394
Thank you everyone for being here!

1182
01:11:03,494 --> 01:11:06,694
Don't forget to check out YouTube Music Weekend right after this!

1183
01:11:06,794 --> 01:11:10,294
And also give a lot of love to I FOUND ME and me!

1184
01:11:10,394 --> 01:11:12,494
この後も見ててね！
Keep watching after this, okay?

1185
01:11:12,594 --> 01:11:14,194
頑張るから！頑張るから！
I'll do my best! I'll do my best!

1186
01:11:14,194 --> 01:11:16,194
応援して、よろしくお願いします！
Please support me, thank you so much!

1187
01:11:16,294 --> 01:11:17,794
Thank you so much for 5 years!

1188
01:11:17,794 --> 01:11:19,194
I'll keep doing my best!

1189
01:11:19,194 --> 01:11:21,194
Bye-bye!

1190
01:11:24,194 --> 01:12:07,694
ほんとうに... ほんとうに ありがとう♡
[Text: Thank you so, so much...♡]

